  "description": "A very simple task scheduler using cron expressions to schedule events.\n    - 5 fields format: [minute] [hour] [day of the month] [month] [day of the week].\n    - 6 fields format: [second] [minute] [hour] [day of the month] [month] [day of the week].\n    - The [year] field is NOT SUPPORTED.\n\nUse ScheduledEvent.Data to pass additional information about the job to be done on the schedule.",
